# Source-only prototype review. Purchased content and local configuration stay private.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.clang-format
!/AGENTS.md
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/Dockerfile
!/AFS.uproject
!/Source/
!/Scripts/
!/Docs/
Source/**
!Source/**/*.h
!Source/**/*.cpp
!Source/**/*.cs
!Source/**/
Scripts/__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Docs are the shared record (scope, rules, lessons, open issues, design); binaries and references stay out.
Docs/References/
Docs/**/*.png
Docs/**/*.jpg
Docs/**/*.mp4
Docs/**/*.json
